  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5705.01 Purpose. This part sets forth the procedure for the dissemination of criminal history information for non-criminal justice purposes, pursuant to the National Crime Prevention and Privacy Compact.\n\nSource. #8173, eff 9-21-04, EXPIRED: 9-21-12\n\nNew. #10208, eff 10-22-12; ss by #12132, eff 3-17-17; renumbered by #12606 (formerly Saf-C 5704.01)",
